"Search for human genes in HGNC by symbol, name, or alias. Supports "
"wildcards (e.g., 'BRCA\\*' find..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hgnc_tools.rst 6193221f9e2f4e97a6f0ef0359f68ce6
msgid "HGNC_search_genes tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hgnc_tools.rst:123 a012b2f034c44c9096ef6ae3db9bf584
msgid "**Name**: ``HGNC_search_genes``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hgnc_tools.rst:125 ada9751fb2874f3c81fdce24c18ab505
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for human genes in HGNC by symbol, name, or "
"alias. Supports wildcards (e.g., 'BRCA\\*' finds BRCA1, BRCA2). Searches "
"across approved symbols and names. Returns a list of matching genes with "
"basic info. Example: 'kinase' searches gene names containing kinase."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hgnc_tools.rst:129 72fcfd71a0cc4ca4a398a9b8ff1f94d9
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query - gene symbol, partial name, "
"or keyword. Supports wildcards (\\*). Examples: 'BRCA\\*', 'tumor "
"protein', 'insulin receptor'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hgnc_tools.rst:132 35568ad1d09847dfb1e385909c0f35b8
msgid ""
"``search_field`` (string, null) (optional) Field to search in. Options: "
"'symbol', 'name', 'alias\\_symbol', 'prev\\_symbol', 'entrez\\_id', "
"'ensembl\\_gene\\_id', 'uniprot\\_ids', 'location'. Default searches "
"across symbol and name."
msgstr ""

